{"ex-E201-1":{"id":"ex-E201-1","chapter":"E201","number":1,"title":"光電效應實驗","question":"<p>根據光電效應實驗的結果，我們得到圖示的光電流 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span> 對光電池電勢差 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的關係線圖。</p><p>(a) 陰極所發射光電子的最高動能是多少（以eV 為單位）？</p><p>(b) 估算陰極每秒發射的光電子數目。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/1388b4e1467b4d5fe9d33464.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:184.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">eV_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 1.8 V = 1.8 eV</p><p>(b) 飽和電流 = 2.8 × 10<sup>–6</sup> A 這表示每秒發射的電荷有 2.8 × 10<sup>–6</sup> C。</p><p>每秒發射的光電子數目</p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Q}{e}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1.60</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2.8 \\times  10^{-6}}{1.60 \\times  10^{-19}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.75 × 10<sup>13</sup></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E201_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"751358028ef19332e8559ae2d10b8cb5498393e049ef1033810c90e054a48195","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,427.0198951171875,557.4491,588.3358917236328],"text":"例 題 1 光電效應實驗\r\n根據光電效應實驗的結果，我們得到圖示的\r\n光電流 I 對光電池電勢差 V 的關係線圖。\r\n(a) 陰極所發射光電子的最高動能是多少（以\r\neV 為單位）？\r\n(b) 估算陰極每秒發射的光電子數目。\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,588.3358917236328,557.4491,743.0198951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) Kmax = eVs = e × 1.8 V = 1.8 eV\r\n(b) 飽和電流 = 2.8 × 10–6 A\r\n這表示每秒發射的電荷有 2.8 × 10–6 C。\r\n每秒發射的光電子數目\r\n = Q\r\ne\r\n = 2.8 × 10–6\r\n1.60 × 10–19 = 1.75 × 1013\r\nI / μA\r\n3\r\n2\r\n1\r\n–2 –1 0 1\r\nV / V\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E201-2":{"id":"ex-E201-2","chapter":"E201","number":2,"title":"根據波動理論的時間延滯","question":"<p>強度為0.01 W m<sup>–2</sup>的光照射銅片，銅片表面的原子須吸收7.5 × 10<sup>–19</sup> J 能量才能發射出電子，而銅原子吸收能量的有效面積為 0.1 nm<sup>2</sup>。根據光的波動理論，估算原子發射出電子所需的最短時間。</p>","answer":"<p>根據強度 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{E}{At}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>強度</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{E}{A \\times  強度}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{7.5 \\times  10^{-19}}{(0.1 \\times  10^{-18})(0.01)}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 750 s</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>1 nm<sup>2</sup> = 1 nm × 1 nm</p><p>= 10<sup>–9</sup> m × 10<sup>–9</sup> m</p><p>= 10<sup>–18</sup> m<sup>2</sup></p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E201_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"751358028ef19332e8559ae2d10b8cb5498393e049ef1033810c90e054a48195","segments":[{"page":9,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,446.5628951171875,562.4491,563.8791961669922],"text":"例 題 2 根據波動理論的時間延滯\r\n強度為0.01 W m–2的光照射銅片，銅片表面的原子須吸收7.5 × 10–19 J\r\n能量才能發射出電子，而銅原子吸收能量的有效面積為 0.1 nm2\r\n。根\r\n據光的波動理論，估算原子發射出電子所需的最短時間。\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,563.8791961669922,562.4491,658.0188951171875],"text":"題解\r\n根據 強度 = E\r\nAt ，\r\nt = E\r\nA × 強度 = 7.5 × 10–19\r\n(0.1 × 10–18)(0.01)\r\n = 750 s\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"tips","box":[40,442.5628951171875,181.4491,658.0188951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n1 nm2\r\n = 1 nm × 1 nm\r\n = 10–9 m × 10–9 m\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E201-3":{"id":"ex-E201-3","chapter":"E201","number":3,"title":"紅光光子的能量","question":"<p>一個 LED 發出紅光，該紅光在真空中的波長為700 nm。</p><p>求一個紅光光子的能量，並</p><p>(a) 以焦耳為單位；</p><p>(b) 以電子伏為單位。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/11ded03722daabba350d8347.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:155.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>c</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>λ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 4.29 × 10<sup>14</sup> Hz</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = (6.63 × 10<sup>–34</sup>)(4.29 × 10<sup>14</sup>) = 2.84 × 10<sup>–19</sup> J</p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 2.84 × 10<sup>–19</sup> × <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 1.78 eV</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E201_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"751358028ef19332e8559ae2d10b8cb5498393e049ef1033810c90e054a48195","segments":[{"page":15,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,220.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 3 紅光光子的能量\r\n一個 LED 發出紅光，該紅光在真空中的波長為\r\n700 nm。\r\n求一個紅光光子的能量，並\r\n(a) 以焦耳為單位；\r\n(b) 以電子伏為單位。\r\n"},{"page":15,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,220.81585693359375,562.4491,342.4998951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) f = c\r\nλ\r\n = 3 × 108\r\n700 × 10–9 = 4.29 × 1014 Hz\r\nE = hf = (6.63 × 10–34)(4.29 × 1014) = 2.84 × 10–19 J \r\n(b) E = 2.84 × 10–19 ×\r\n1\r\n1.60 × 10–19 = 1.78 eV\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E201-4":{"id":"ex-E201-4","chapter":"E201","number":4,"title":"每秒撞擊表面的光子數目","question":"<p>頻率為 4.3 × 10<sup>14</sup> Hz、強度為 0.05 W m<sup>–2</sup> 的紅光垂直照射一個平面，照亮的面積為 4 × 10<sup>–4</sup> m<sup>2</sup>。</p><p>(a) 每秒有多少光子撞擊該平面？</p><p>(b) 如果以頻率為 6.7 × 10<sup>14</sup> Hz 的藍光取代紅光，而光的強度相同，每秒有多少光子撞擊該平面？</p>","answer":"<p>強度 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{E}{At}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N(hf )}{At}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 強度 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{A}{hf}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{R}}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 強度 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{A}{hf_{R}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 0.05 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.63</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4.3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{4 \\times  10^{-4}}{(6.63 \\times  10^{-34})(4.3 \\times  10^{14})}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 7.02 × 10<sup>13</sup></p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{B}}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 強度 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{A}{hf_{B}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 0.05 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.63</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.7</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{4 \\times  10^{-4}}{(6.63 \\times  10^{-34})(6.7 \\times  10^{14})}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 4.50 × 10<sup>13</sup></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E201_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"751358028ef19332e8559ae2d10b8cb5498393e049ef1033810c90e054a48195","segments":[{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,562.4491,214.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 4 每秒撞擊表面的光子數目\r\n頻率為 4.3 × 1014 Hz、強度為 0.05 W m–2 的紅光垂直照射一個平\r\n面，照亮的面積為 4 × 10–4 m2\r\n。\r\n(a) 每秒有多少光子撞擊該平面？\r\n(b) 如果以頻率為 6.7 × 1014 Hz 的藍光取代紅光，而光的強度相同，\r\n每秒有多少光子撞擊該平面？\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,214.81585693359375,562.4491,498.3528951171875],"text":"題解\r\n強度 = E\r\nAt = N(hf )\r\nAt\r\n∴\r\nN\r\nt\r\n = 強度 ×\r\nA\r\nhf\r\n(a) NR\r\nt = 強度 ×\r\nA\r\nhfR\r\n = 0.05 ×\r\n4 × 10–4\r\n(6.63 × 10–34)(4.3 × 1014)\r\n = 7.02 × 1013\r\n(b) NB\r\nt = 強度 ×\r\nA\r\nhfB\r\n = 0.05 ×\r\n4 × 10–4\r\n(6.63 × 10–34)(6.7 × 1014)\r\n = 4.50 × 1013\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E201-5":{"id":"ex-E201-5","chapter":"E201","number":5,"title":"鈉的功函數和臨閾頻率","question":"<p>鈉的功函數是 2.3 eV。</p><p>(a) 一些光子落在鈉板表面，每個光子的能量為 1.78 eV。解釋光電效應會否發生。</p><p>(b) (i) 求鈉的臨閾頻率。</p><p>(ii) 要令鈉發生光電效應，入射光的最大波長（即臨閾波長）λ<sub>max</sub> 是多少？</p><p>(iii) 波長為 450 nm 的藍光照射鈉板表面。解釋光電效應會否發生。</p><p>(c) 為甚麼光電子發射沒有時間延滯？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 每個入射光子的能量均低於功函數，因此光電效應不會發生。</p><p>(b) (i) 根據 ϕ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">hf_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{ϕ}{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.3</mn><mi>e</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6.63</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mi>J</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2.3 eV}{6.63 \\times  10^{-34} J s}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.60</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mi>J</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6.63</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mi>J</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2.3 \\times  1.60 \\times  10^{-19} J}{6.63 \\times  10^{-34} J s}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 5.551 × 10<sup>14</sup> Hz ≈ 5.55 × 10<sup>14</sup> Hz</p><p>(ii) λ<sub>max</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{c}{f_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>5.551</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3 \\times  10^{8}}{5.551 \\times  10^{14}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 5.40 × 10<sup>–7</sup> m</p><p>(iii) 該藍光的波長比 λ<sub>max</sub> 短，因此光電效應會發生。</p><p>(c) 電子只要吸收一個具足夠能量的光子，它就會立即從鈉板表面發射。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E201_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"751358028ef19332e8559ae2d10b8cb5498393e049ef1033810c90e054a48195","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[185.5491,238.57189511718752,562.5491,475.88836669921875],"text":"例 題 5 鈉的功函數和臨閾頻率\r\n鈉的功函數是 2.3 eV。\r\n(a) 一些光子落在鈉板表面，每個光子的能量為 1.78 eV。解釋光電效\r\n應會否發生。\r\n(b) (i) 求鈉的臨閾頻率。\r\n (ii) 要令鈉發生光電效應，入射光的最大波長（即臨閾波長）λ max\r\n是多少？\r\n (iii) 波長為 450 nm 的藍光照射鈉板表面。解釋光電效應會否\r\n發生。\r\n(c) 為甚麼光電子發射沒有時間延滯？\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[185.5491,475.88836669921875,562.5491,755.9248951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 每個入射光子的能量均低於功函數，因此光電效應不會發生。\r\n(b) (i) 根據 ϕ = hf0，\r\n f0 = ϕ\r\nh = 2.3 eV\r\n6.63 × 10–34 J s\r\n = 2.3 × 1.60 × 10–19 J\r\n6.63 × 10–34 J s\r\n= 5.551 × 1014 Hz\r\n≈ 5.55 × 1014 Hz\r\n (ii) λ max = c\r\nf0\r\n = 3 × 108\r\n5.551 × 1014 = 5.40 × 10–7 m\r\n (iii) 該藍光的波長比 λ max 短，因此光電效應會發生。\r\n(c) 電子只要吸收一個具足夠能量的光子，它就會立即從鈉板表面\r\n發射。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E201-6":{"id":"ex-E201-6","chapter":"E201","number":6,"title":"光電子的最高動能","question":"<p>某金屬的功函數為 2.49 eV，它受頻率為 7.5 × 10<sup>14</sup> Hz 的光照射。一個電子的質量為 9.11 × 10<sup>–31</sup> kg。</p><p>(a) 求金屬所發射出光電子的最高動能 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{ma}</annotation></semantics></math></span>（<sub>x</sub> 以 J 為單位）。</p><p>(b) 求金屬所發射出光電子的最高速率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(c) 如果改用較高頻率的光，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 將出現甚麼變化？</p><p>(d) 為甚麼金屬發射的光電子有不同動能，不一定是 (a) 部求得的值？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> – ϕ</p><p>= (6.63 × 10<sup>–34</sup>) (7.5 × 10<sup>14</sup>) – (2.49) (1.60 × 10<sup>–19</sup>)</p><p>= 9.89 × 10<sup>–20</sup> J</p><p>(b) 由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup></mrow></math>，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math> = 4.66 × 10<sup>5</sup> m s<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(c) 增加</p><p>(d) 不在表面的電子需要大於逸出功的能量才能逸出。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>以 J 表示 ϕ。</p><p>提示</p><p>由 K<sub>max</sub> = hf – ϕ，f ↑ ⇒ K<sub>max</sub> ↑</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E201_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"751358028ef19332e8559ae2d10b8cb5498393e049ef1033810c90e054a48195","segments":[{"page":21,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,347.2318951171875,562.6491,530.548095703125],"text":"例 題 6 光電子的最高動能\r\n某金屬的功函數為 2.49 eV，它受頻率為 7.5 × 1014 Hz 的光照射。一\r\n個電子的質量為 9.11 × 10–31 kg。\r\n(a) 求金屬所發射出光電子的最高動能 Kmax（以 J 為單位）。\r\n(b) 求金屬所發射出光電子的最高速率 vmax。\r\n(c) 如果改用較高頻率的光，Kmax 將出現甚麼變化？\r\n(d) 為甚麼金屬發射的光電子有不同動能，不一定是 (a) 部求得的值？\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,530.548095703125,562.6491,743.5848951171876],"text":"題解\r\n(a) Kmax = hf – ϕ\r\n = (6.63 × 10–34) (7.5 × 1014) – (2.49) (1.60 × 10–19)\r\n = 9.89 × 10–20 J\r\n(b) 根據 Kmax = 1\r\n2\r\nmevmax\r\n2\r\n，\r\nvmax = •  \r\n2Kmax\r\nme\r\n = •  \r\n2(9.89 × 10–20)\r\n9.11 × 10–31 = 4.66 × 105\r\n m s–1\r\n(c) 上升\r\n(d) 不是位於金屬表面的電子，需要多於功函數的能量才能脫離金屬。\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"tips","box":[40,343.2318951171875,181.6491,743.5848951171876],"text":"提提你\r\n以 J 表示 ϕ。\r\n提提你\r\n根據 Kmax = hf – ϕ，\r\nf ↑ ⇒ Kmax ↑\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E201-7":{"id":"ex-E201-7","chapter":"E201","number":7,"title":"I–V 線圖","question":"<p>在光電效應實驗中，單色光束照射在光電池的陰極上，每個光子的能量為 4.5 eV。下圖顯示光電流 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span> 怎樣隨光電池兩極之間的電勢差 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span> 改變。光電池的陽極接駁至電源的正極時，取 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span> 為正。</p><p>(a) 求光電池陰極的功函數（以 eV 為單位）。</p><p>(b) 如果光強度增加而頻率保持不變，草繪新的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span>–<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span> 線圖。</p><p>(c) 如果用頻率為 7 × 10<sup>14</sup> Hz 的光重複這實驗，遏止電勢是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/43c2f1a442dea58acdcb5ecc.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:285.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> × 2 V = 2 eV</p><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> – ϕ，</p><p>ϕ = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> – <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = 4.5 – 2 = 2.5 eV</p><p>(b)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/321de79779cf82e49a55a4f4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:292.9px\"></p><p>(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> – ϕ = (6.63 × 10<sup>−34</sup>)(7 × 10<sup>14</sup>)(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>) – 2.5 = 0.401 eV</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 0.401 V</p><p>練習 1.2 第 10 題（第 31 頁）</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>以 eV 表示 hf。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E201_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"751358028ef19332e8559ae2d10b8cb5498393e049ef1033810c90e054a48195","segments":[{"page":23,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,371.60809326171875],"text":"例 題 7 I–V 線圖\r\n在光電效應實驗中，單色光束照射在光電池的陰極上，每個光子的能\r\n量為 4.5 eV。下圖顯示光電流 I 怎樣隨光電池兩極之間的電勢差 V 改\r\n變。光電池的陽極接駁至電源的正極時，取 V 為正。\r\nI\r\n–3 –2 –1 0 1 2 3\r\nV / V\r\n(a) 求光電池陰極的功函數（以 eV 為單位）。\r\n(b) 如果光強度增加而頻率保持不變，草繪新的 I–V 線圖。\r\n(c) 如果用頻率為 7 × 1014 Hz 的光重複這實驗，遏止電勢是多少？\r\n"},{"page":23,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,371.60809326171875,562.4491,708.4998951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) Kmax = eVs = e × 2 V = 2 eV\r\n根據 Kmax = hf – ϕ，\r\nϕ = hf – Kmax = 4.5 – 2 = 2.5 eV\r\n(b) I\r\n–3 –2 –1 0 1 2 3\r\nV / V\r\n較低光強度\r\n較高光強度\r\n(c) Kmax = hf – ϕ\r\n = (6.63 × 10 − 34)(7 × 1014)\r\n• 1\r\n1.60 × 10–19 •\r\n – 2.5 \r\n = 0.401 eV\r\nVs = Kmax\r\ne = 0.401 eV\r\ne\r\n = 0.401 V\r\n單元練習1.2 Q10 (p.31)\r\n"},{"page":23,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718752,181.4491,708.4998951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n以 eV 表示 hf。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E201-8":{"id":"ex-E201-8","chapter":"E201","number":8,"title":"Vs–f 線圖","question":"<p>在光電效應實驗中，學生以不同頻率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的光輪流照射金屬 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>，並記錄相應的遏止電勢 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，最後得到圖示的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span>–<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 線圖。</p><p>(a) 估算金屬 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的臨閾頻率。</p><p>(b) 利用線圖計算普朗克常數的實驗值。</p><p>(c) 利用 (b) 部求得的普朗克常數數值，估算金屬 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的功函數（以 eV 為單位）。</p><p>(d) 學生改用功函數較小的金屬 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 重複實驗。草繪金屬 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span>–<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 線圖。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/1fa7648c34391087e0157a2c.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:227.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 5 × 10<sup>14</sup> Hz</p><p>(b) 圖線的斜率 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 斜率 × <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> × 1.60 × 10<sup>–19</sup> = 6.4 × 10<sup>–34</sup> J s</p><p>(c) ϕ = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 2 eV</p><p>(d)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/b2ae8d9f4d17484bc9fd2ef5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:227.9px\"></p>","tips":"<p>注意：求斜率時，不要使用 (0, 0) 點，因為直線並不通過原點。留意 f 的因子 10<sup>14</sup>。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E201_TN_ce_.pdf","sha256":"751358028ef19332e8559ae2d10b8cb5498393e049ef1033810c90e054a48195","segments":[{"page":27,"kind":"question","box":[52.0001,250.2848951171875,562.4491,455.6009826660156],"text":"例 題 8 Vs–f 線圖\r\n在光電效應實驗中，學生以不同頻率 f 的光輪流照射金屬 A，並\r\n記錄相應的遏止電勢 Vs，最後得到圖示的 Vs–f 線圖。\r\n(a) 估算金屬 A 的臨閾頻率。\r\n(b) 利用線圖計算普朗克常數的實驗值。\r\n(c) 利用 (b) 部求得的普朗克常數數值，估算金屬 A 的功函數\r\n（以 eV 為單位）。\r\n(d) 學生改用功函數較小的金屬 B 重複實驗。草繪金屬 B 的 Vs–f 線圖。\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"answer","box":[52.0001,455.6009826660156,562.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 5 × 1014 Hz\r\n(b) 線圖斜率 = h\r\ne\r\nh = 斜率 × e = 1.2 – 0\r\n(8 – 5) × 1014\r\n× 1.60 × 10–19 = 6.4 × 10–34 J s\r\n(c) ϕ = hf0 = (6.4 × 10–34)(5 × 1014)\r\n1.60 × 10–19 = 2 eV\r\n(d) \r\n0 5 8\r\n1.2\r\nf / 1014 Hz\r\nVs / V\r\nB A\r\n注意\r\n線圖並沒有通過原點，計算線\r\n圖斜率時不要使用點 (0, 0)。\r\n讀取 f 的值時不要忘記乘以\r\n1014。\r\n0 5 8\r\n1.2\r\nf / 1014 Hz\r\nVs / V\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}